From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: nmcu2780 <203441210+nmcu2780@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 13:44:57 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 09/20] i18n: translate share, prompt, multiple-select and
 strider plugins

Translate all user-visible text. Share plugin consts become functions so
tr() can run at display time; long/short hint variants keep the upstream
width-based selection. Multiple-select keeps key names and translates the
descriptions. Strider help lines and prompt form validation messages are
wrapped at display points only.
